1
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:46,060
Fu Ming Yu's strengths.

2
00:01:46,954 --> 00:01:48,634
One.

3
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:59,806
He's tall. He has a great physique.

4
00:02:05,226 --> 00:02:07,846
What else?

5
00:02:11,322 --> 00:02:13,480
I'm doomed.

6
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:16,344
I really am blinded by his looks.

7
00:02:16,344 --> 00:02:21,409
I can't think of anything else.
All I can see is his handsome face.

8
00:02:26,364 --> 00:02:28,922
He's not a good talker.

9
00:02:28,922 --> 00:02:32,292
Even his pick-up lines are half-baked.

10
00:02:32,292 --> 00:02:36,200
He wavers between confidence and conceit.

11
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:40,188
He's always so busy.
Has no time to spend with me.

12
00:02:40,188 --> 00:02:44,033
He provides me with
no emotional support at all.

13
00:02:44,033 --> 00:02:49,575
And somehow, he manages to get under my skin.

14
00:02:49,575 --> 00:02:54,270
Well, he's very emotionally stable.

15
00:02:54,270 --> 00:02:56,720
He wears a grumpy face all day, though.

16
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:59,941
Why on earth am I into him?

17
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:08,480
[Episode 15]
[Boyfriend's Character]

18
00:03:12,419 --> 00:03:14,939
You used to be a flight attendant.

19
00:03:15,692 --> 00:03:19,457
You know exactly what happens
when a VIP passenger files a complaint.

20
00:03:19,457 --> 00:03:23,407
Are you asking me to make an exception for you?

21
00:03:23,407 --> 00:03:25,771
I'm not here to plead for her.

22
00:03:25,771 --> 00:03:28,048
Nor am I asking you to make an exception.

23
00:03:28,048 --> 00:03:30,128
This whole thing is obviously unfair.

24
00:03:30,128 --> 00:03:32,240
That passenger is a total nightmare.

25
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,600
He thinks a Platinum Card makes him a god.

26
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:38,480
He wanted an unlimited supply of slippers,
eye masks, blankets, pillows, and wine.

27
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:41,439
She even served his meal early
so he could rest more. What more could she do?

28
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:44,807
Besides, I was there.
Jiang Zi Yue did nothing wrong.

29
00:03:44,807 --> 00:03:47,752
He insulted her first
and even tried to hit her.

30
00:03:47,752 --> 00:03:49,736
We were kind enough not to call the police.

31
00:03:49,736 --> 00:03:52,800
He was being unreasonable.
Who is he to demand that she be fired?

32
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:57,240
We checked the surveillance footage.
Jiang Zi Yue did say some nasty things.

33
00:03:57,240 --> 00:04:01,904
And given her past conduct,
firing her isn't unreasonable.

34
00:04:01,904 --> 00:04:04,264
How is it reasonable?

35
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:08,868
When safety issues arise,
flight attendants are the last to leave.

36
00:04:08,868 --> 00:04:11,413
But whenever there's trouble,
they're the first to blame.

37
00:04:11,413 --> 00:04:16,720
If we have to satisfy every ridiculous demand,
what's the point of a restricted Platinum Card?

38
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:19,117
Might as well put him
in business class every time.

39
00:04:19,117 --> 00:04:23,023
In this matter, if the airline
won't stand by its employees,

40
00:04:23,023 --> 00:04:25,932
how can they possibly feel
any sense of security or belonging?

41
00:04:25,932 --> 00:04:30,812
What if I told you I fired her for your sake?

42
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,720
For my sake?

43
00:04:34,818 --> 00:04:36,418
For what?

44
00:04:36,418 --> 00:04:40,662
During the investigation, Bai Yang found
that after you left Hengshi Air,

45
00:04:40,662 --> 00:04:44,037
Jiang Zi Yue started all the rumors about you.

46
00:04:44,037 --> 00:04:46,842
We cannot tolerate that kind of character.

47
00:04:46,842 --> 00:04:49,708
Don't use me as an excuse.

48
00:04:49,708 --> 00:04:52,409
Actually, I already knew about all of this.

49
00:04:52,409 --> 00:04:54,713
I'm not being a saint.

50
00:04:54,713 --> 00:04:58,617
I just think humans are complicated.

51
00:04:58,617 --> 00:05:02,160
Before she hurt me with those rumors,
she had helped me.

52
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:07,560
Even though I don't know her reasons yet,
I have my own judgment on these things.

53
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:11,208
What happens between us
is our own personal matter.

54
00:05:11,208 --> 00:05:14,032
Fu Ming Yu, where's your sense of fairness?

55
00:05:14,032 --> 00:05:16,152
My sense of fairness?

56
00:05:16,873 --> 00:05:21,244
If I strictly kept work and personal separate,
would I keep indulging you like this?

57
00:05:30,314 --> 00:05:33,331
And you still say
you're not here to plead for her?

58
00:05:33,331 --> 00:05:35,875
But today, I've seen a new side of you.

59
00:05:35,875 --> 00:05:37,360
I'm impressed.

60
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:43,120
Since you know what she did behind your back,
you're still willing to speak up for her.

61
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:46,225
What if it were me?

62
00:05:46,225 --> 00:05:48,529
If I were in the same situation someday,

63
00:05:48,529 --> 00:05:53,089
would you put in as much effort
as you did today to plead for me?

64
00:05:53,784 --> 00:05:56,224
That depends on the situation.

65
00:05:57,189 --> 00:06:00,259
But you're at Hengshi Air.
What could possibly happen to you?

66
00:06:04,637 --> 00:06:08,594
But... I can promise you one thing.

67
00:06:09,356 --> 00:06:10,480
Promise what?

68
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:15,057
I can keep our relationship separate
from my work.

69
00:06:15,057 --> 00:06:17,681
I won't let feelings affect my work.

70
00:06:17,681 --> 00:06:21,993
Nor will I let work come between us.

71
00:06:25,170 --> 00:06:28,985
Then would you do me the honor
of having dinner with me?

72
00:06:28,985 --> 00:06:30,946
Is this a quid pro quo?

73
00:06:30,946 --> 00:06:33,086
You could say that.

74
00:06:43,626 --> 00:06:45,566
It's so beautiful here.

75
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:49,080
- Are you hungry?
- Yes.

76
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:51,160
Then let's order plenty.

77
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:53,040
- This way, please.
- Okay.

78
00:06:53,877 --> 00:06:55,457
Here.

79
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:01,583
- Okay, thank you.
- You're welcome.

80
00:07:01,583 --> 00:07:04,807
Mr. Fu, would you like to
keep your usual style of ordering?

81
00:07:04,807 --> 00:07:06,432
Something light?

82
00:07:06,432 --> 00:07:09,856
- Could you bring me the menu?
- Certainly.

83
00:07:14,060 --> 00:07:17,140
Here you go. See if there's anything you like.

84
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:40,840
Excuse me, Ms. Ruan.
Would you like me to recommend some dishes?

85
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,959
I'll take another look.

86
00:07:42,959 --> 00:07:44,839
Of course, no problem.

87
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:47,760
Order whatever you like.

88
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:50,352
This is way too expensive.

89
00:07:50,352 --> 00:07:53,193
I have a membership card. We'll get a discount.

90
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:58,240
What did Mrs. He usually order?

91
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:01,240
She would order our signature dishes.

92
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:05,545
Honeycomb crispy fried oysters,
Jiangzhou spicy red mullet with scallion,

93
00:08:05,545 --> 00:08:10,520
honey-braised beef short ribs,
and stir-fried asparagus with lilies.

94
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:12,320
She has pretty good taste.

95
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,345
- Is that okay?
- Yes.

96
00:08:14,345 --> 00:08:15,560
We'll have those, then.

97
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:18,224
No problem. Thank you for your order. Here.

98
00:08:18,224 --> 00:08:20,424
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

99
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:24,343
Mr. Fu, let me know if you need anything else.

100
00:08:24,343 --> 00:08:25,807
- I'll be nearby.
- Okay, thank you.

101
00:08:25,807 --> 00:08:27,668
My pleasure.

102
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:31,409
Is Mrs. He the one...

103
00:08:31,409 --> 00:08:35,038
You've met her before.
One of my most important clients.

104
00:08:35,038 --> 00:08:37,362
You two come here often?

105
00:08:37,362 --> 00:08:39,209
Are you jealous?

106
00:08:39,209 --> 00:08:40,800
Before, it was for work.

107
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:44,520
This time is different.
This time, I'm here with my girlfriend.

108
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,721
So the food will definitely taste much better.

109
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,040
[Bai Yang]

110
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:53,440
It's Bai Yang. I'll take this.

111
00:08:57,001 --> 00:08:58,619
Hello?

112
00:08:59,540 --> 00:09:01,135
Excuse me. Here is your first course.

113
00:09:01,135 --> 00:09:03,680
Yes, I'm out right now.

114
00:09:07,718 --> 00:09:10,625
Can't you and Wang Le Kang go first?

115
00:09:10,625 --> 00:09:12,409
Okay. I see.

116
00:09:12,409 --> 00:09:16,280
I need some time to get there.
I'll hang up now.

117
00:09:24,339 --> 00:09:26,848
- Is it urgent?
- Yes.

118
00:09:26,848 --> 00:09:28,600
Something came up at the company.

119
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:32,360
It's okay. I can eat by myself.
Go take care of it.

120
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:35,080
But you ordered so much. I can't finish it all.

121
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,560
It's fine.

122
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:39,189
Since it's already ordered,
eat as much as you can.

123
00:09:39,189 --> 00:09:40,709
Here.

124
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:54,400
- I can do it myself.
- I know you can.

125
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,920
But I want to do this for you.

126
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:59,280
Thank you.

127
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:01,864
The red mullet here is delicious.

128
00:10:01,864 --> 00:10:04,448
You can't find this flavor anywhere else.

129
00:10:04,448 --> 00:10:07,711
If you can't finish it, I'll ask the manager
to prepare some takeout boxes.

130
00:10:07,711 --> 00:10:09,400
You can take it all home.

131
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:10,819
Okay, I got it.

132
00:10:10,819 --> 00:10:13,640
Go. Don't let me delay you.

133
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:17,372
Take your time eating.
Let me know when you get home.

134
00:10:17,372 --> 00:10:18,640
Be careful on your way.

135
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:20,360
I'm leaving now.

136
00:10:31,042 --> 00:10:33,461
I forgot something very important.

137
00:10:39,857 --> 00:10:41,457
I'm off.

138
00:10:51,163 --> 00:10:54,043
Welcome. Do you have a reservation?

139
00:10:57,765 --> 00:11:00,448
No. Is there a private room available?

140
00:11:00,448 --> 00:11:02,153
The private rooms are all booked up.

141
00:11:02,153 --> 00:11:04,400
I'll try to find a quiet table for you.

142
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:07,520
I told you we should've come earlier.
Now all the good seats are gone.

143
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:09,560
Why don't we eat somewhere else?

144
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,520
I've wanted to eat here for a long time.

145
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:12,520
Let's eat here then.

146
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:14,225
Sure.

147
00:11:14,225 --> 00:11:15,849
- This way, please.
- Please.

148
00:11:15,849 --> 00:11:17,712
Why didn't you make a reservation?

149
00:11:17,712 --> 00:11:19,560
I didn't expect it to be booked out.

150
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:22,120
Besides, sitting outside
might be more lively with the crowd.

151
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:25,279
- Enough with the excuses.
- A lively atmosphere makes food taste better.

152
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:26,360
- Please.
- Thank you.

153
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:29,960
- Order more dishes. A small table is nice.
- Over here.

154
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,320
- Go sit there.
- You're really noisy.

155
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,720
Go on.

156
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,639
- They'll serve the food from here.
- Right.

157
00:11:34,639 --> 00:11:37,502
Go sit there, or they might spill on you.

158
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:56,640
Si Xian, are you eating here alone?

159
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,864
Fu Ming Yu had something to take care of.

160
00:12:01,864 --> 00:12:04,168
That's great.

161
00:12:04,168 --> 00:12:05,711
Let's eat together then.

162
00:12:05,711 --> 00:12:09,711
Why are you two always together lately?

163
00:12:09,711 --> 00:12:12,680
- As you can see.
- Are you dating?

164
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:14,505
We're trying things out.

165
00:12:14,505 --> 00:12:16,469
Yan An, come and eat over here.

166
00:12:16,469 --> 00:12:18,828
- Over here.
- Okay.

167
00:12:19,502 --> 00:12:22,342
Perfect. I'm going to the restroom.

168
00:12:25,754 --> 00:12:27,338
Are you really together?

169
00:12:27,338 --> 00:12:29,682
It's a probation period.

170
00:12:29,682 --> 00:12:34,320
Yan An... has an extensive dating history.
You know that, right?

171
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:36,559
We grew up together.

172
00:12:36,559 --> 00:12:38,640
What could he possibly do
that I don't know about?

173
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:40,720
So you're okay with that?

174
00:12:44,803 --> 00:12:48,251
I really think Yan An is great.

175
00:12:48,251 --> 00:12:50,035
Look at him.

176
00:12:50,035 --> 00:12:53,720
He's witty, humorous,
and emotionally supportive.

177
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:58,211
And don't you think he's quite handsome?

178
00:12:58,211 --> 00:13:00,475
Dashing and charming.

179
00:13:00,475 --> 00:13:02,600
Anyway, I think he's better than Big-Head Fu.

180
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:05,641
Big-Head Fu left you here to eat all
by yourself. He won't even stay with you.

181
00:13:05,641 --> 00:13:09,078
Yan An is different.
Whatever I do, he's always by my side.

182
00:13:09,078 --> 00:13:11,422
Maybe you've been abroad for too long
and don't know him well.

183
00:13:11,422 --> 00:13:15,726
I don't need to
learn about my boyfriend from others.

184
00:13:15,726 --> 00:13:19,110
By the way, you're starting to
sound like my mom.

185
00:13:19,110 --> 00:13:21,440
Besides, is Big-Head Fu really that great?

186
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:25,041
Doesn't he have a dark past or any bad habits?

187
00:13:25,884 --> 00:13:29,024
The food you're eating right now
is all paid for by him.

188
00:13:29,024 --> 00:13:32,400
Badmouthing him while eating his food.
That's biting the hand that feeds you.

189
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:34,464
- Stop eating.
- You...

190
00:13:34,464 --> 00:13:36,688
Waiter, I'd like all this to go.

191
00:13:36,688 --> 00:13:39,072
- Why are you getting so worked up?
- My boyfriend paid for this.

192
00:13:39,072 --> 00:13:40,640
If you want to eat, ask yours to treat you.

193
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:43,945
You're becoming more and more like Big-Head Fu.

194
00:13:43,945 --> 00:13:45,585
Stingy.

195
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,864
Where's the food?

196
00:13:53,864 --> 00:13:55,928
It left with someone.

197
00:13:55,928 --> 00:13:57,952
She left? Where to? Why did she leave?

198
00:13:57,952 --> 00:14:01,759
You should really give me credit for this.
I just did something big.

199
00:14:01,759 --> 00:14:04,600
- Let's hear it.
- I put you and Fu Ming Yu together

200
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,840
and compared you two thoroughly.

201
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:08,240
I helped you save face.

202
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:13,185
Compared to Fu Ming Yu,
I'm definitely the better one.

203
00:14:13,185 --> 00:14:15,800
You should leave with her too.

204
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:18,400
Order whatever you want. It's on me.

205
00:14:28,370 --> 00:14:31,058
Mr. Fu. Mr. Su came on short notice.

206
00:14:31,058 --> 00:14:32,962
He's going on a business trip
to Berlin tomorrow.

207
00:14:32,962 --> 00:14:35,400
Time was too tight, so I called you.

208
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:37,020
I know.

209
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:44,265
Fu Ming Yu is worse than Yan An?

210
00:14:44,265 --> 00:14:47,328
He's much better than Yan An, okay?

211
00:14:47,328 --> 00:14:52,092
When it comes to Fu Ming Yu's strengths,
I could go on all day.

212
00:14:54,595 --> 00:14:58,555
Fu Ming Yu's strengths.

213
00:15:00,027 --> 00:15:02,250
He's handsome.

214
00:15:02,250 --> 00:15:05,635
Way more handsome than Yan An.

215
00:15:05,635 --> 00:15:07,555
I'll write them down.

216
00:15:17,506 --> 00:15:19,766
What else?

217
00:15:57,920 --> 00:16:03,920
[Fu Ming Yu's strengths]
[Handsome/ Tall/ Great physique/ A good kisser]

218
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:16,600
Don't turn on the lights.

219
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,080
But it's so dark.

220
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:20,800
Besides, if Fu Ming Yu were here,
it would be awkward.

221
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:22,960
That's what makes it exciting.

222
00:16:39,945 --> 00:16:42,457
Why is Si Xian alone?

223
00:16:43,466 --> 00:16:45,266
What's this?

224
00:16:53,113 --> 00:16:56,017
Fu Ming Yu's strengths.

225
00:16:56,017 --> 00:16:58,441
Handsome. Tall. Great physique.

226
00:16:58,441 --> 00:17:01,320
- A good kisser?
- Who is it?

227
00:17:06,599 --> 00:17:08,614
- I see. Excuse me for a moment.
- Okay.

228
00:17:08,614 --> 00:17:12,720
Wait, Mr. Fu. A toast to you.
Thank you for years of support.

229
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:14,480
Sure, Mr. Su.

230
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:16,520
Here, Mr. Su. Let me propose a toast to you.

231
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:18,880
- Thank you for your support.
- The feeling is mutual.

232
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:20,880
- Excuse me.
- Go ahead.

233
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:24,427
Mr. Su. Do you remember our last meeting?
I'm very grateful.

234
00:17:24,427 --> 00:17:26,291
- I do.
- Cheers.

235
00:17:26,291 --> 00:17:27,559
- Come, join us.
- Hello.

236
00:17:27,559 --> 00:17:28,960
- Cheers.
- Thank you very much.

237
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:31,080
Thank you so much for supporting Hengshi Air.

238
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,559
[Ruan Si Xian]
<i>What are you doing?</i>

239
00:17:32,559 --> 00:17:34,680
Cheers.

240
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,560
Ming Yu?

241
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:39,061
It's you, right? Fu Ming Yu.

242
00:17:41,305 --> 00:17:42,560
And you are?

243
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:47,320
It's me, Li Zhi Huai. Don't you remember me?

244
00:17:50,730 --> 00:17:52,594
Freeze.

245
00:17:52,594 --> 00:17:55,458
This is a very serious situation.

246
00:17:55,458 --> 00:17:57,682
Things have gone this far,
and you're still not talking?

247
00:17:57,682 --> 00:18:01,400
Xiao Zhen, I told you
a surprise attack would work.

248
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:04,480
Fine. I'm having my clam noodles now.
I've been craving this.

249
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:06,740
Go ahead and eat.

250
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:13,572
So, how good of a kisser is he?

251
00:18:13,572 --> 00:18:15,956
Give us the details.
Don't just focus on eating.

252
00:18:15,956 --> 00:18:18,460
I'm not telling. Anyway, you already know.

253
00:18:18,460 --> 00:18:19,560
And you're eating my food.

254
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:23,423
Don't bite the hand that feeds you.
After this meal, no more teasing.

255
00:18:23,423 --> 00:18:24,767
Oh my god.

256
00:18:24,767 --> 00:18:30,800
Xiao Zhen, we're finally living the high life
thanks to our dear friend.

257
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:33,880
Xuan, don't just talk. Give it a try.

258
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:35,040
Okay.

259
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:38,619
Let me see how delicious this feast really is.

260
00:18:42,235 --> 00:18:44,978
Expensive food really is different.
It's so good.

261
00:18:44,978 --> 00:18:48,907
Look at you. You're ignoring this feast
to eat those cheap noodles.

262
00:18:48,907 --> 00:18:52,211
Can't you see each dish
only has a tiny portion?

263
00:18:52,211 --> 00:18:54,640
If I ate it all,
how could I bring some back for you?

264
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:57,400
I did this for you,
and you're still nagging me?

265
00:18:57,400 --> 00:19:00,504
Besides, this is what I crave.
I love clam noodles.

266
00:19:00,504 --> 00:19:02,728
You're truly generous.

267
00:19:02,728 --> 00:19:04,592
But I have one question.

268
00:19:04,592 --> 00:19:06,616
Can you two actually eat together?

269
00:19:06,616 --> 00:19:08,560
Why wouldn't we be able to?

270
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:10,320
It's not like he has pica.

271
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:11,880
Don't we eat the same things?

272
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:14,760
Do you? There's a huge difference.

273
00:19:14,760 --> 00:19:17,320
This bowl of yours costs 24 yuan at most.

274
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:21,510
It's not that I can't afford his meal,
but it's still painful to pay for.

275
00:19:21,510 --> 00:19:25,695
I'm not trying to rain on your parade,
but I think you have different spending habits.

276
00:19:25,695 --> 00:19:28,840
Don't you feel like
you're from different worlds?

277
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:31,840
You can tell that from just one meal?

278
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:37,640
Some people eat at the same table every day
yet still don't know each other.

279
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:42,820
But people with different values
rarely work out in the end.

280
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:53,864
It's true that
it makes a relationship difficult.

281
00:19:53,864 --> 00:19:58,960
But values aren't about food,
things you use, or hobbies.

282
00:19:58,960 --> 00:20:03,369
He can enjoy the finer things,
while I enjoy the simpler ones.

283
00:20:03,369 --> 00:20:06,994
As long as I don't think
he's being extravagant when he dines well,

284
00:20:06,994 --> 00:20:11,058
and he doesn't think I'm unrefined
when I eat calm noodles.

285
00:20:11,058 --> 00:20:12,918
Isn't that enough?

286
00:20:15,843 --> 00:20:17,744
In this life,

287
00:20:17,744 --> 00:20:23,720
if you can meet someone completely
on your wavelength, you're lucky.

288
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:27,372
But no two leaves are exactly alike,

289
00:20:27,372 --> 00:20:30,600
let alone humans.

290
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:35,040
But being different doesn't mean conflict.

291
00:20:35,040 --> 00:20:39,744
Instead, it expands each other's horizons.

292
00:20:39,744 --> 00:20:43,124
Life will become much broader too.

293
00:21:00,456 --> 00:21:02,096
Eat up.

294
00:21:09,779 --> 00:21:15,259
Ever since the funeral,
she has totally changed.

295
00:21:17,848 --> 00:21:22,706
She's lost a lot of weight too.
Lately, I haven't looked after her enough.

296
00:21:22,706 --> 00:21:26,690
Your words of wisdom today
were just the nourishment she needed.

297
00:21:26,690 --> 00:21:28,594
She's been saying lately that

298
00:21:28,594 --> 00:21:31,874
she'll never meet anyone
who understands her like Lu Ming.

299
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:35,424
- She's coming.
- Where are you flying tomorrow?

300
00:21:35,424 --> 00:21:38,369
Two legs. Chun City and Ping City.

301
00:21:38,369 --> 00:21:39,640
It's getting late.

302
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:41,705
- Let's head out.
- Okay.

303
00:21:41,705 --> 00:21:44,838
Xiao Zhen, are you staying here tonight?

304
00:21:44,838 --> 00:21:47,382
I'd better not. You have work tomorrow.

305
00:21:47,382 --> 00:21:49,862
- Let's take the trash out.
- Okay.

306
00:21:50,777 --> 00:21:52,080
Take care, you two.

307
00:21:52,080 --> 00:21:53,800
- Call me when you get home.
- Will do.

308
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:56,720
Don't call. Just send a text.

309
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:59,121
- We're off.
- Bye. Take care.

310
00:22:16,122 --> 00:22:18,402
[Fu Ming Yu]
<i>What are you doing?</i>

311
00:22:25,556 --> 00:22:28,329
<i>Thinking about the differences between us.</i>

312
00:22:57,920 --> 00:23:02,400
[Mingchen Residences]
[6:00]

313
00:23:06,120 --> 00:23:10,480
[Mingchen Residences]
[7:00]

314
00:23:18,319 --> 00:23:20,160
[Fu Ming Yu]
<i>Where are you flying today?</i>

315
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:21,760
<i>Chun City.</i>

316
00:23:23,873 --> 00:23:27,753
<i>Okay. I'll be back tomorrow. Wait for me.</i>

317
00:23:28,724 --> 00:23:30,498
<i>Got it.</i>

318
00:23:32,267 --> 00:23:35,227
Was that a bit too cold?

319
00:23:42,440 --> 00:23:47,160
[Mingchen Residences]
[7:30]

320
00:24:08,393 --> 00:24:12,273
[Jiang City Base]
[8:50]

321
00:24:16,119 --> 00:24:19,520
<i>Breathalyzer test passed.</i>

322
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:27,840
[Jiang City Airport]
[10:00]

323
00:24:37,600 --> 00:24:42,360
[To Chun City]
[11:00]

324
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:51,600
This weather won't be easy to navigate.
We need to be prepared.

325
00:24:51,600 --> 00:24:54,080
Prepare for a long haul.

326
00:24:54,080 --> 00:24:57,840
Don't say that. You might jinx us.

327
00:24:58,796 --> 00:25:03,324
<i>Hengshi Air 5949. Heavy rain in Chun City.
Confirm your intentions.</i>

328
00:25:03,324 --> 00:25:05,748
Roger, Hengshi Air 5949.

329
00:25:05,748 --> 00:25:07,372
We'll hold and wait.

330
00:25:07,372 --> 00:25:10,516
Check the weather at both alternate airports.

331
00:25:10,516 --> 00:25:11,621
Roger.

332
00:25:11,621 --> 00:25:14,779
[Holding and burning fuel]
[12:30]

333
00:25:16,737 --> 00:25:20,361
Captain, the first alternate airport,
Yantai, has good weather.

334
00:25:20,361 --> 00:25:22,080
Okay.

335
00:25:22,080 --> 00:25:26,520
Chun City, Hengshi Air 5949.
We have enough fuel to hold for over an hour.

336
00:25:26,520 --> 00:25:28,720
If the weather doesn't improve,
we'll divert to Yantai.

337
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:31,763
<i>Roger, Hengshi Air 5949.</i>

338
00:25:31,763 --> 00:25:33,400
Okay.

339
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:40,240
[Divert to Yantai Airport]
[14:50]

340
00:26:03,320 --> 00:26:06,760
[Yantai Airport]
[16:30]

341
00:26:06,760 --> 00:26:08,680
Please remain patient.

342
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:11,480
Once we receive a departure time,
we will update you.

343
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:12,839
- What's going on?
- Oh my.

344
00:26:12,839 --> 00:26:14,680
- Please be patient.
- Sorry for the trouble.

345
00:26:14,680 --> 00:26:16,079
I have things to do.

346
00:26:16,079 --> 00:26:17,440
I already made an appointment.

347
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:19,240
Ready for clearance, Hengshi Air 5949.

348
00:26:19,240 --> 00:26:22,759
Pre-departure clearance copied.
Stand 02, ready.

349
00:26:22,759 --> 00:26:25,599
<i>Hengshi Air 5949, due to weather,
aircraft are in sequence.</i>

350
00:26:25,599 --> 00:26:28,360
<i>You're number 14 for departure.
Estimated one departure every ten minutes.</i>

351
00:26:28,360 --> 00:26:30,160
Any possibility of an earlier slot?

352
00:26:30,160 --> 00:26:34,080
<i>The slots aren't fixed. Many aircraft
diverted here. There's quite a backlog.</i>

353
00:26:38,336 --> 00:26:40,600
Hello, cockpit. This is the purser.

354
00:26:40,600 --> 00:26:43,360
<i>We estimate another 140-minute wait.</i>

355
00:26:43,360 --> 00:26:44,400
That long?

356
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:47,065
Nothing we can do. It's the weather.
We have to queue here.

357
00:26:47,065 --> 00:26:48,529
<i>Copy that.</i>

358
00:26:48,529 --> 00:26:52,553
<i>Then we'll need the ground crew
to provide extra meals and drinks.</i>

359
00:26:52,553 --> 00:26:55,377
What a pity. We're stuck on the plane.

360
00:26:55,377 --> 00:26:59,600
The sea intestine rice at Yantai Airport
is incredibly delicious.

361
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:04,680
I didn't know you were such a foodie.
Just stick to your crew meal.

362
00:27:07,651 --> 00:27:09,799
[Yantai Airport]
When are we going to take off?

363
00:27:09,799 --> 00:27:12,799
- Sorry. We're not sure yet.
- Can't you confirm the time?

364
00:27:12,799 --> 00:27:15,200
Due to the weather,
we can't give a definite time.

365
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:18,240
Sorry. Please be patient.

366
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:20,279
We can't just keep drinking water.

367
00:27:20,279 --> 00:27:23,217
Young lady. This cabin is stuffy. I feel sick.

368
00:27:23,217 --> 00:27:26,320
Can you open the door?
Let me get some fresh air.

369
00:27:26,320 --> 00:27:28,560
Ma'am, we can't open the door right now.

370
00:27:28,560 --> 00:27:31,039
How about this? I'll get you some water.

371
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:33,280
And please be patient.

372
00:27:33,280 --> 00:27:34,319
Purser!

373
00:27:34,319 --> 00:27:36,280
- How much longer will this take?
- Pursuer!

374
00:27:36,280 --> 00:27:40,280
Are we flying or not?
My family is waiting for me.

375
00:27:40,280 --> 00:27:41,840
What's the situation? Can we still fly?

376
00:27:41,840 --> 00:27:44,119
I completely understand how you feel right now.

377
00:27:44,119 --> 00:27:45,960
Our plane is already in the queue.

378
00:27:45,960 --> 00:27:47,920
- Please bear with us.
- I can't.

379
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:49,640
Try sitting here for three hours yourself!

380
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:51,240
- Sorry.
- I have a meeting today.

381
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:53,000
Sorry for taking up your precious time.

382
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:54,559
Open the door. We're getting off.

383
00:27:54,559 --> 00:27:57,559
If we open the door now,
we'll have to re-queue later.

384
00:27:57,559 --> 00:27:58,759
Please understand.

385
00:27:58,759 --> 00:28:00,280
You always use the weather as an excuse.

386
00:28:00,280 --> 00:28:03,120
My wife said
it's not even raining in Chun City.

387
00:28:03,120 --> 00:28:05,279
- We should've taken the high-speed train.
- I'm sorry, sir.

388
00:28:05,279 --> 00:28:08,020
We would've arrived by train by now.

389
00:28:10,426 --> 00:28:12,410
Hello, Captain. This is the purser.

390
00:28:12,410 --> 00:28:14,993
<i>A few passengers have decided
to cancel their trip.</i>

391
00:28:14,993 --> 00:28:16,337
<i>I can't change their minds.</i>

392
00:28:16,337 --> 00:28:19,560
If they leave, we'll lose our spot in line.
Try to persuade them again.

393
00:28:19,560 --> 00:28:21,280
We've already waited an hour and a half.

394
00:28:21,280 --> 00:28:24,077
Yes, Captain. But I've said all I could.

395
00:28:24,077 --> 00:28:25,839
They're still insisting on getting off.

396
00:28:25,839 --> 00:28:27,400
<i>I'll call the company.</i>

397
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:29,920
Okay. I'll contact ground service.

398
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:33,440
Gosh. Just when we finally
saw a glimmer of hope.

399
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:36,624
It's okay.
After a few more times, you'll get used to it.

400
00:28:36,624 --> 00:28:38,603
I'd rather not.

401
00:28:40,320 --> 00:28:46,320
[Yantai Airport]
[18:30]

402
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:51,265
Ready for clearance, Hengshi Air 5949.

403
00:28:51,265 --> 00:28:55,089
<i>Hengshi Air 5949.
Departure sequence. Expect a one-hour delay.</i>

404
00:28:58,800 --> 00:29:03,169
Me and my big mouth.
I'd better watch what I say.

405
00:29:03,169 --> 00:29:04,520
- This is such a delay.
- Yeah.

406
00:29:04,520 --> 00:29:06,359
- I have so much to do today.
- Me too.

407
00:29:06,359 --> 00:29:08,320
Purser, come here.

408
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:10,160
Hello, sir. How can I help you?

409
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:11,840
Are you people for real?

410
00:29:11,840 --> 00:29:14,799
Didn't you just say we were about to take off?
Another hour has passed!

411
00:29:14,799 --> 00:29:17,600
Sir, our plane is already
in the departure queue.

412
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:21,720
Since there are many delayed flights,
please return to your seat and wait patiently.

413
00:29:21,720 --> 00:29:23,720
- Who has any patience left?
- Patience?

414
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:25,519
Our patience ran out long ago.

415
00:29:25,519 --> 00:29:28,600
I'm telling you,
you must give us an explanation!

416
00:29:28,600 --> 00:29:29,640
We deserve an answer.

417
00:29:29,640 --> 00:29:31,639
Yes, we are truly sorry.

418
00:29:31,639 --> 00:29:37,630
[Yantai Airport]
[19:30]

419
00:29:54,359 --> 00:29:57,359
Pick up the speed.
We still have another leg to fly.

420
00:29:57,359 --> 00:29:58,920
Roger.

421
00:29:59,960 --> 00:30:02,080
Speed selected. 320.

422
00:30:02,080 --> 00:30:03,680
Checked.

423
00:30:07,138 --> 00:30:13,138
[Chun City Airport]
[20:40]

424
00:30:20,420 --> 00:30:22,119
Hello, welcome aboard.

425
00:30:22,119 --> 00:30:23,279
Sorry to keep you waiting.

426
00:30:23,279 --> 00:30:25,960
[Chun City to Jiang City/ 20:55]
Welcome aboard.

427
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:27,000
- Hello, sir.
- Welcome aboard.

428
00:30:27,000 --> 00:30:29,599
- Welcome aboard.
- Sir, sorry to keep you waiting.

429
00:30:29,599 --> 00:30:32,599
- Sir, your seat is this way.
- Welcome aboard, little one.

430
00:30:32,599 --> 00:30:35,248
Welcome aboard. Sorry to keep you waiting.

431
00:30:46,910 --> 00:30:50,680
Ready for clearance, Hengshi Air 5949.
Is there a slot yet?

432
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:54,920
<i>Hengshi Air 5949. Departure time 1315.</i>

433
00:30:54,920 --> 00:30:58,120
Departure time is 21:15.

434
00:30:58,120 --> 00:31:01,520
Our flight plan shows
a flight time of two hours.

435
00:31:01,520 --> 00:31:05,440
We'll land at 23:15,
not including taxiing and shutdown.

436
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:07,760
We'll exceed duty time after 23:00.

437
00:31:07,760 --> 00:31:11,480
[Crew reaching 14-hour duty limit]

438
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:14,920
<i>Captain. The national traffic system assigned
a departure time of 1315.</i>

439
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:16,440
<i>En-route weather is bad.</i>

440
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:19,440
<i>Your duty time will exceed the limit.
The company decided to cancel the flight.</i>

441
00:31:19,440 --> 00:31:21,183
Alright.

442
00:31:21,183 --> 00:31:22,360
Si Xian.

443
00:31:22,360 --> 00:31:25,600
Do you want to try making
the flight cancellation announcement?

444
00:31:25,600 --> 00:31:27,200
Sure.

445
00:31:30,345 --> 00:31:34,409
Dear passengers,
I am the co-pilot of this flight, Ruan Si Xian.

446
00:31:34,409 --> 00:31:37,593
We regret to inform you
that due to thunderstorms,

447
00:31:37,593 --> 00:31:40,400
<i>we have no choice but to
cancel this flight for your safety.</i>

448
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:41,440
How can you cancel it?

449
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:42,680
<i>For the inconvenience caused...</i>

450
00:31:42,680 --> 00:31:44,000
We've waited for eight hours!

451
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:46,839
You can't just cancel it like that!

452
00:31:46,839 --> 00:31:48,960
- We apologize.
- This is ridiculous.

453
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:50,505
- What a waste of time.
- We apologize.

454
00:31:50,505 --> 00:31:52,519
- What's going on?
- Can we sue them for this?

455
00:31:52,519 --> 00:31:53,960
- We apologize.
- What can we do?

456
00:31:53,960 --> 00:31:55,839
Do you think a simple "sorry" is enough?

457
00:31:55,839 --> 00:31:58,200
Do you know how many orders
I've lost because of you?

458
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:59,519
Can you afford to pay me back?

459
00:31:59,519 --> 00:32:01,839
If I lose my job,
none of you will keep yours either!

460
00:32:01,839 --> 00:32:03,440
We are truly sorry, sir.

461
00:32:03,440 --> 00:32:04,720
You're still smiling?

462
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:06,279
You're still smiling, aren't you?

463
00:32:06,279 --> 00:32:07,720
- You're still smiling!
- Sir!

464
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:10,899
What's so funny? Is it funny?

465
00:32:12,683 --> 00:32:15,079
- Keep smiling!
- It's not funny at all.

466
00:32:15,079 --> 00:32:16,279
What a waste of time.

467
00:32:16,279 --> 00:32:17,920
- We're sorry.
- We're sorry. Take care.

468
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:19,519
- We're sorry.
- Unbelievable.

469
00:32:19,519 --> 00:32:22,720
[Crew stranded at Chun City Airport]
Mom, I really don't want to do this anymore.

470
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:24,240
It's been a long day.

471
00:32:24,240 --> 00:32:27,680
They almost hit us
just because of our "smile service."

472
00:32:27,680 --> 00:32:30,880
Why don't we ask this hotel
if they have any rooms left?

473
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,319
- Forget it.
- They're full too.

474
00:32:32,319 --> 00:32:34,160
- I'll call you later.
- Too many stranded passengers.

475
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:36,000
Everywhere is fully booked.

476
00:32:38,994 --> 00:32:40,418
Hello?

477
00:32:40,418 --> 00:32:42,002
<i>Where are you?</i>

478
00:32:42,002 --> 00:32:43,760
Waiting for a taxi.

479
00:32:43,760 --> 00:32:46,240
We haven't found a hotel yet.
I'll talk to you later.

480
00:32:46,240 --> 00:32:48,280
Why are you hanging up already?

481
00:32:48,280 --> 00:32:51,680
When a problem arises,
shouldn't I be the first to know?

482
00:32:53,633 --> 00:32:55,947
How did you get here?

483
00:32:55,947 --> 00:33:00,372
I was worried my independent girlfriend
might forget I exist. So I came over.

484
00:33:00,372 --> 00:33:03,236
Honestly, he's getting smoother and smoother.

485
00:33:03,236 --> 00:33:05,460
I sent you so many messages.
Why didn't you reply?

486
00:33:05,460 --> 00:33:08,520
Can't you see I'm busy looking for a hotel?

487
00:33:08,520 --> 00:33:12,261
No need to look anymore.
There are no vacancies in the nearby hotels.

488
00:33:13,251 --> 00:33:15,976
- Where are we going?
- It's all been arranged.

489
00:33:17,475 --> 00:33:20,440
But... but... What about... the others?

490
00:33:20,440 --> 00:33:22,545
Will I only take care of you
and ignore everyone else?

491
00:33:22,545 --> 00:33:23,609
Let's go.

492
00:33:23,609 --> 00:33:25,353
- Thank you, Mr. Fu.
- Thank you, Mr. Fu!

493
00:33:25,353 --> 00:33:27,313
Let's go.

494
00:33:31,570 --> 00:33:34,024
What's wrong?
You look like you want to say something.

495
00:33:34,800 --> 00:33:38,280
It's nothing. It just feels quite surreal.

496
00:33:38,280 --> 00:33:42,281
An hour ago,
we didn't even know where we'd sleep.

497
00:33:44,040 --> 00:33:49,880
So, at this moment, don't you think
being the boss's girlfriend is actually nice?

498
00:33:55,455 --> 00:33:59,815
Boss, let me tell you something.

499
00:34:01,038 --> 00:34:06,938
If one day you stop liking me,
you must let me know.

500
00:34:06,938 --> 00:34:10,362
Call me, tell me in person,
or even just send a text.

501
00:34:10,362 --> 00:34:15,490
Don't worry. I won't pester you,
and I won't ask for a breakup fee.

502
00:34:15,490 --> 00:34:20,120
But you can't take back
that double relocation fee.

503
00:34:20,120 --> 00:34:24,520
You've promised that.
It's clearly signed in the contract.

504
00:34:26,915 --> 00:34:28,939
I'd like to ask you, too.

505
00:34:28,939 --> 00:34:32,243
Why are you putting a jinx on us
by saying we'll break up?

506
00:34:32,243 --> 00:34:35,507
I'm just speaking hypothetically.

507
00:34:35,507 --> 00:34:40,971
If one day you fall for someone else
without telling me,

508
00:34:40,971 --> 00:34:42,844
I'll...

509
00:34:42,844 --> 00:34:46,440
You'll... You'll what?

510
00:34:46,440 --> 00:34:50,219
I'm being serious here.
Why are you leaning in so close?

511
00:34:54,131 --> 00:34:57,221
We can talk about serious things
while standing close.

512
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:03,711
Then I'll...

513
00:35:05,280 --> 00:35:07,224
send a funeral wreath to you.

514
00:35:07,224 --> 00:35:10,624
I'll put your memorial altar front and center.

515
00:35:13,227 --> 00:35:16,367
You'll put my memorial altar front and center?

516
00:35:17,720 --> 00:35:21,680
I think you don't want to leave
this small room at all.

517
00:35:27,687 --> 00:35:32,119
I'm sleepy. I want to... go to sleep.

518
00:35:32,119 --> 00:35:34,520
Sure. Let's sleep.

519
00:35:34,520 --> 00:35:36,360
Where do you want to sleep?

520
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:38,119
I'll...

521
00:35:38,119 --> 00:35:41,687
go to Ni... Well... Ni Tong's place.

522
00:35:41,687 --> 00:35:44,336
She's too scared to sleep alone.

523
00:35:54,260 --> 00:35:57,559
Good night. Sleep tight.

524
00:35:57,559 --> 00:35:59,699
Good night. I'm leaving.

525
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:03,844
Actually, I'm scared to sleep alone too.

526
00:36:13,844 --> 00:36:18,867
The situation you mentioned...
I won't let it happen.

527
00:36:25,218 --> 00:36:26,882
- Captain Pu.
- Mr. Bai.

528
00:36:26,882 --> 00:36:30,160
Morning, Si Xian.
Mr. Fu had some business and left early.

529
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:32,840
He asked me to get the car ready
to take you to the airport.

530
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:34,320
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

531
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:36,200
Everyone, please follow me.

532
00:36:36,200 --> 00:36:39,000
There's a bus at the entrance.
We'll go to the airport.

533
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:41,240
Alright, this way.

534
00:36:44,531 --> 00:36:46,411
<i>Are you mad?</i>

535
00:37:09,640 --> 00:37:11,502
<i>What are you doing?</i>

536
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:17,830
<i>Picking out a lover.</i>

537
00:37:21,185 --> 00:37:24,744
<i>I like these guys. Take a look.</i>

538
00:37:34,328 --> 00:37:36,480
Is one lover not enough?

539
00:37:36,480 --> 00:37:38,560
Of course not.

540
00:37:41,719 --> 00:37:46,160
<i>One is definitely not enough.
I need some backups.</i>

541
00:37:50,601 --> 00:37:54,640
<i>How about this one? He looks a bit like you.</i>

542
00:37:56,474 --> 00:37:58,809
<i>Then pick him.</i>

543
00:37:59,418 --> 00:38:04,498
As long as you change guys fast enough,
there will be no sadness, only love.

544
00:38:08,322 --> 00:38:10,906
Ming Yu. Thanks for
taking me to the train station.

545
00:38:10,906 --> 00:38:13,266
No problem. It was on my way.

546
00:38:47,019 --> 00:38:49,701
<i>Why isn't he back yet?</i>

547
00:38:58,308 --> 00:39:00,491
Fu Ming Yu?

548
00:39:00,491 --> 00:39:02,196
I'm back.

549
00:39:02,196 --> 00:39:04,490
- Have you been drinking?
- Yes.

550
00:39:05,280 --> 00:39:08,119
Come in first.

551
00:39:13,240 --> 00:39:16,160
Careful. Easy.

552
00:39:16,160 --> 00:39:18,520
Why didn't you answer my calls?

553
00:39:18,520 --> 00:39:20,160
Your calls?

554
00:39:26,715 --> 00:39:29,155
You called so many times.

555
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:34,960
I'm sorry. I put my phone in the fridge.

556
00:39:35,762 --> 00:39:39,640
- Here, drink this.
- In the fridge?

557
00:39:39,640 --> 00:39:42,479
Putting your phone in the fridge?

558
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:47,464
- Or are you avoiding me?
- Are you kidding me?

559
00:39:47,464 --> 00:39:51,800
- That phone is my baby.
- Am I not your baby?

560
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:55,784
Since when were you? You're still on probation.

561
00:39:58,233 --> 00:40:00,213
Fu Ming Yu.

562
00:40:01,755 --> 00:40:04,962
Fu Ming Yu? Are you asleep?

563
00:40:04,962 --> 00:40:09,866
I waited for you for so long,
and you just fell asleep like that?

564
00:40:09,866 --> 00:40:12,290
Who were you drinking with? What did you drink?

565
00:40:12,290 --> 00:40:14,274
Why did you drink? You're not telling me?

566
00:40:14,274 --> 00:40:15,874
Right.

567
00:40:16,480 --> 00:40:18,760
Right?

568
00:40:21,481 --> 00:40:27,160
I must say, for a grown man,
how are your eyelashes so long?

569
00:40:27,160 --> 00:40:30,144
And your nose is so straight.

570
00:40:30,144 --> 00:40:33,352
I could use it as a slide. Slide right down.

571
00:40:33,352 --> 00:40:36,152
That'll take you down a peg.

572
00:40:40,962 --> 00:40:46,440
These lips look so soft and bouncy.
No wonder they're so kissable.

573
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:49,680
Keep looking.

574
00:40:50,851 --> 00:40:53,275
If you keep looking, I'll eat you up.

575
00:40:53,275 --> 00:40:58,219
With the way you are now,
it's hard to say who'll eat whom.

576
00:40:58,219 --> 00:41:01,843
If you keep acting up,
I'll devour you completely,

577
00:41:01,843 --> 00:41:04,003
then dump you at a garbage station.

578
00:41:07,539 --> 00:41:11,348
Which category should I put you in?

579
00:41:11,348 --> 00:41:13,508
Hazardous waste.

580
00:41:23,360 --> 00:41:26,905
Si Xian. Promise me one thing.

581
00:41:26,905 --> 00:41:28,840
What is it?

582
00:41:28,840 --> 00:41:31,844
If one day you stop liking me,

583
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:37,432
you must tell me to my face.

584
00:41:37,432 --> 00:41:42,536
No texting, and no calling.

585
00:41:42,536 --> 00:41:45,471
You must tell me in person.

586
00:41:45,471 --> 00:41:48,671
So I can know
what it is you don't like about me.

587
00:41:49,840 --> 00:41:51,784
I can change.

588
00:41:51,784 --> 00:41:57,528
But you must never throw me away like trash.

589
00:41:57,528 --> 00:42:02,192
You must never throw me away.

590
00:42:02,192 --> 00:42:04,984
If you don't wake up soon,

591
00:42:04,984 --> 00:42:08,720
I'll throw you away.

592
00:42:08,720 --> 00:42:11,599
Didn't we agree?

593
00:42:11,599 --> 00:42:14,440
You can't throw me away.

594
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:18,000
I won't throw you away. I won't.

595
00:42:18,665 --> 00:42:21,960
- You can't throw me away.
- I won't.

596
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:24,440
You can't throw me away.
